    "findings": [
      "files are replaced (new inode, mode kept): hard links keep old content; read-only files in writable directories are edited",
      "unread Edit and Write succeed (Edit flags contentNotInModelContext); stale reads are refused",
      "UTF-16LE detected by BOM for Edit; Read shows UTF-8 lossy; Latin-1 edits become UTF-8 with replacement characters",
      "CRLF files: content matched as LF; inserted LF becomes CRLF; old_string with CR does not match; CRLF in new_string stays as given in LF files",
      "empty old_string creates/fills, else 'Cannot create new file - file already exists.'; directory Write has its own message"
    ]
